    detail: "Every figure below was MEASURED by running each file at the base (b9e0bdb, in a temporary worktree) and at this tip — the first version of this note estimated three of them and the review caught all three, so nothing here is counted by hand. setup.test.ts 40 -> 75 (+35): the sixteen short forms asserted literally against design run #9's table, one case per verdict for the value and its remedy, one asserting every short is <=40 chars (StatusLine's anatomy cap, the reason the field exists), one proving the two error verdicts do NOT interpolate into the short form (a 500-character error still yields 'install failed'), one proving a verdict carries no instruction (foreign's short excludes the sentence its remedy holds), and a count assertion pinning the table at 16 so a new verdict cannot be added without landing here. components/StatusLine.test.tsx 18 -> 23 (+5): the extend's contract — the message carries the verdict tone for ok and warn while muted stays ink-mute, it renders `short`, and it refuses to render `remedy`. components/Checkbox.test.tsx 0 -> 6 (NEW): reports the boolean not the event, holds no value of its own, the label is inside the hit target, disabled reports nothing, no indeterminate state, and it carries the focus ring (added after the review found it had none). components/CopyText.test.tsx 7 -> 9 (+2): the error state — a refused write says 'copy failed' and clears on the same ~2s timer. Onboarding.test.tsx 19 -> 29 (+10), rewritten to the new surface with every old assertion's intent preserved; the rewrite is itself evidence, since the deleted 'Next moves the active step forward' maps to a design line that deleted the control. Five of its additions are the review's regression tests: the trust remedy renders, the un-probeable trust step says what will settle it, a failed install shows its error once not twice, the proxy command appears EXACTLY ONCE (counting <li> elements, not substring-matching), and the proxy-off command is copyable. components/collection.test.tsx 81 -> 86 (+5): the registry oracle, which grew when Checkbox joined the vocabulary. onboardingMachine.test.ts 9 -> 8 (-1): the test that kept next/back alive is replaced by one covering goto, the navigation that actually ships."
  integration:
