    detail: "ProxyCloseDialog.test.tsx 0 -> 30 (NEW): the file did not exist. The app's only modal — and the only screen that can strand a machine with no internet — had no test at all. All three modes' action sets (ours/foreign actionable, remote info-only); 'keep' gone as a second name for quitting, asserted both as a missing control and as absent copy; the remedy's failure relabelling the SAME slot to 'try again' with quit still one click away; try again re-running it; the opt-out reaching onAcknowledge with its value and never offered where something local can be fixed; and the modal shell — Esc, backdrop and dismiss each cancelling in each mode (9 cases), focus entering the panel, focus RETURNING to the invoker on unmount, and the Tab trap. closeConfirm.test.tsx 12 -> 10 (-2): the two dialog tests moved to the file where they belong; the hook's own tests were updated to the three-mode model, and one existing test was deliberately inverted (see notes)."
  e2e:
