    detail: "ui/e2e/specs/onboarding.spec.ts +2, one renamed. The spec was NOT rewritten wholesale: its selectors survived the rebuild because the step containers kept their data-testid, so the spine is untouched (fresh launch -> onboarding -> a real decrypted HTTPS flow through the real proxy -> the list revealed -> filter narrows -> live append). The two additions prove what the redesign IS: every step carries a verdict, and NO prev/next pair exists — the navigation the design deliberately removed is as much the contract as the verdicts it kept; and a step opens from its own header with exactly one body open. Hermetic: ephemeral ports, the harness's own local origin, no public network."
